# Mintlify automatically ignores these files and directories:
# .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md
#
# Customer pages live ONLY under the active locale directories (see
# i18n/locales.json). Everything below is repository-only and must never be
# published. `npm run check:publish` enforces this.

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx

# Repository documents (listed explicitly even where Mintlify ignores them)
AGENTS.md
README.md
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
LICENSE
/*.md

# Repository tooling and configuration sources
scripts/
i18n/
package.json
package-lock.json
